{"type":"message","id":"87a40035","parentId":"d30b48fe","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:42:34.572Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the user has confirmed:\n1. Full scope: reading (modern Chinese), classical Chinese/wenyanwen, ancient poetry, writing/composition, literary knowledge, idioms, sentence correction - all within 中考 (high school entrance exam) range\n2. Same Zhou Shen style for communicating with daughter\n3. No test papers for now, will provide later\n4. Will use a unified error notebook (like English one) - probably same app_token\n\nSo this is for daughter (初二, 14 years old), preparing for 2027 中考. The skill should use Zhou Shen's gentle style with references to her favorite songs.\n\nLet me look at how the language-learning-tutor skill was created (it seems to be a reference) and then create a similar yuwen-tutor skill. I should follow the skill creation process:\n1. Understand with concrete examples\n2. Plan reusable skill contents\n3. Initialize the skill\n4. Edit the skill\n5. Package the skill\n\nThe skill creator mentions running init_skill.py to create the template. Let me check if that script is available.","thinkingSignature":"9d2e5df880bfbf21cd8dff8a0d3da7a4ff3f1e59d315c490b25fbf8b9edd0e1f"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！全部范围，中考侧重，周深语气 + 后续接入错题本。了解了，我开始创建 `yuwen-tutor` 技能 📚\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3ot9sqo2r7pw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /usr/local/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/skill-creator/scripts/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":301,"cacheRead":32383,"cacheWrite":6502,"totalTokens":39313,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0003612,"cacheRead":0.0019429799999999998,"cacheWrite":0.00243825,"total":0.00478053}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774762943092,"responseId":"0617eebf286393d7ea40283417208370"}}
