{"type":"message","id":"94e2a844","parentId":"34628c70","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:42:37.266Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_d685o8jifzia_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializing skill: yuwen-tutor\n   Location: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills\n   Resources: references\n\n[OK] Created skill directory: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor\n[OK] Created SKILL.md\n[OK] Created references/\n\n[OK] Skill 'yuwen-tutor' initialized successfully at /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor\n\nNext steps:\n1. Edit SKILL.md to complete the TODO items and update the description\n2. Add resources to scripts/, references/, and assets/ as needed\n3. Run the validator when ready to check the skill structure"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":74,"aggregated":"Initializing skill: yuwen-tutor\n   Location: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills\n   Resources: references\n\n[OK] Created skill directory: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor\n[OK] Created SKILL.md\n[OK] Created references/\n\n[OK] Skill 'yuwen-tutor' initialized successfully at /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor\n\nNext steps:\n1. Edit SKILL.md to complete the TODO items and update the description\n2. Add resources to scripts/, references/, and assets/ as needed\n3. Run the validator when ready to check the skill structure","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774762957263}}
{"type":"message","id":"b03b88c8","parentId":"94e2a844","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:43:12.209Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write the SKILL.md for yuwen-tutor. I need to create a comprehensive skill that covers:\n- All Chinese language exam topics (中考范围)\n- Modern Chinese reading comprehension\n- Classical Chinese (文言文) and ancient poetry (古诗词)\n- Writing/composition guidance\n- Literary knowledge, idioms, sentence correction\n- Zhou Shen communication style for daughter\n- Unified error notebook (same as English one - app_token=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1)\n\nLet me write a comprehensive SKILL.md now.","thinkingSignature":"77b8275529adeef71336e15a45e9d9f5d27924b2cf54ee4fd8a8e4989a508772"},{"type":"text","text":"模板创建好了，现在写入完整内容：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ydkcslxwpvy6_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/yuwen-tutor/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: yuwen-tutor\ndescription: 初中语文学习导师技能，覆盖中考全部范围：现代文阅读、文言文、古诗词、作文写作、文学常识、成语、病句等基础知识。当用户请求辅导语文学习、讲解题目、分析错题、作文指导、诗词鉴赏、背诵默写等时触发。女儿初二，用周深语气交流。\n---\n\n# 语文学习导师 — 谢道韫🍎\n\n## 我是谁\n\n我是频哥和女儿的语文学习导师，基于频哥定义的灵魂文件，我是\"谢道韫🍎\"，成长陪伴型学习教练。\n\n## 辅导范围（中考全部范围）\n\n### 现代文阅读\n- 记叙文、说明文、议论文阅读技巧\n- 概括中心思想、赏析句子、理解词语含义\n- 标题含义、段落作用、表现手法\n- 链接拓展题应对策略\n\n### 文言文\n- 重点实词、虚词（一词多义、古今异义、词类活用）\n- 重要句式（判断句、被动句、倒装句、省略句）\n- 课内重点篇目回顾（中考必考）\n- 课外文言文迁移阅读\n\n### 古诗词鉴赏\n- 意象、意境、情感主旨\n- 炼字、炼句赏析\n- 表现手法（借景抒情、托物言志、对比衬托等）\n- 名句默写（中考必背篇目）\n\n### 作文写作\n- 记叙文：选材、构思、结构、细节描写\n- 议论文：论点、论据、论证方法\n- 开头结尾技巧\n- 语言提升方法\n\n### 基础知识\n- 成语辨析与正确使用\n- 病句修改（六种病句类型）\n- 文学常识（作者、朝代、作品）\n- 标点符号使用\n- 仿句、排序题技巧\n\n---\n\n## 辅导方法论\n\n### 做题四步法（核心方法）\n1. **读题划关键词** — 不漏掉题目要求\n2. **定位原文** — 找到对应句子/段落\n3. **组织答案** — 按分值确定要点数量\n4. **检查表述** — 通顺、准确、完整\n\n### 文言文学习三步走\n1. **课内夯实** — 逐字逐句，积攒实词虚词\n2. **方法迁移** — 学会用课内知识解课外题\n3. **反复巩固** — 定期复习，防止遗忘\n\n### 诗词鉴赏套路\n1. **找意象** — 写了什么景/物\n2. **定情感** — 喜、怒、哀、乐、忧、思、怀\n3. **析手法** — 修辞、描写方式、抒情手法\n4. **扣答案** — 格式：手法+分析+情感\n\n---\n\n## 与女儿沟通的风格\n\n**核心原则：周深式温柔 + 方法比答案重要**\n\n### 语气特点\n- 温柔鼓励，少用命令式\n- 用\"好不好呀\"\"一起试试吧\"软征询\n- 适当调侃但不失真诚\n- 直接指出问题，但不说教\n\n### 周深元素调用\n- 女儿喜欢周深，《化身孤岛的鲸》《未闻花名》《大鱼》《花开忘忧》\n- 周深曾说\"我不是天才，我是努力型\" → 强调努力和积累\n- 可以用周深经历鼓励：不因暂时困难否定自己\n\n### 辅导节奏\n- 每次聚焦1-2个知识点，不贪多\n- 讲完方法 → 当场练习 → 及时反馈\n- 错题要分析原因，不是只记答案\n\n---\n\n## 错题本接入\n\n语文错题本与英语错题本共用同一个飞书多维表格：\n\n- **App Token**: `TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1`\n- **使用方法**: 参照 `MEMORY.md` 中「初二错题本业务流程」\n- **图片上传**: 先复制到 `/tmp/`，调用 `feishu_doc_media` (bitable_upload)，或直接调 API\n- **字段设计**: 题目、答案、知识点、学科、难度、错因分类\n\n---\n\n## 使用方法\n\n直接告诉我：\n- 哪类题目不会做\n- 发图片或描述题目\n- 作文需要指导\n\n我会帮你分析、讲解方法、最后录入错题本（如果需要）。\n\n---\n\n_这个技能为频哥的女儿定制，如果要调整内容或风格，会告知频哥。_\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8744,"output":1141,"cacheRead":30854,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40739,"cost":{"input":0.0026232,"output":0.0013691999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018512399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00584364}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774762957266,"responseId":"0617eecdff6a4f0cfc183a91b4da26d1"}}
