{"type":"message","id":"fe875efa","parentId":"74a60dd6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T05:58:59.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to compare the latest models from each provider. Let me think about what's current as of my knowledge cutoff:\n\n- **ChatGPT**: GPT-4o (released May 2024), GPT-4o mini, and o3/o4 models\n- **Gemini**: Gemini 2.0 (Flash, Pro, Ultra), Gemini 1.5 Pro/Flash\n- **Kimi**: Kimi (Moonshot AI) - latest is Kimi k1.5 / Kimi Pro\n\nActually I don't have real-time information about the very latest models since my knowledge cutoff. But I can share what I know. Let me be honest about my limitations - I don't have definitive real-time model comparisons.\n \nI should be transparent that my training data has a cutoff and I might not have the absolute latest model versions for all of these, so I'll give the most informed comparison I can while acknowledging those limitations.","thinkingSignature":"4bc38c890de6efe8a5dd129de5fc09c7d3a3428cf896d3cae4401d02c2c43eaf"},{"type":"text","text":"说实话，我对各平台最新模型的实时能力没有完整数据，不敢乱排。\n\n**我知道的大致情况：**\n\n- **ChatGPT**：o3 / o4（推理能力强，写作更连贯）\n- **Gemini**：2.0 Flash / 2.0 Pro（多模态强，逻辑好）\n- **Kimi**：k1.5 / k1.5 Pro（中文理解强，长上下文处理优秀）\n\n---\n\n**但关键问题不是谁最强，而是谁最适合孩子。**\n\n中考作文有几个特殊要求：\n1. 语言要像初中生写的，不能太成熟\n2. 结构要符合考场作文套路\n3. 立意要正面、积极\n\n这些对 AI 来说其实挺难兼顾的——AI 容易\"过度润色\"把文章改得太华丽，反而失去初中生的真实感。\n\n---\n\n与其比模型，**不如我直接给孩子改一版**，我了解她的水平，能把握好那个\"像初中生但不幼稚\"的度。要不要试试？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":396,"cacheRead":43548,"cacheWrite":604,"totalTokens":44675,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0004752,"cacheRead":0.0026128799999999997,"cacheWrite":0.0002265,"total":0.00335268}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774763924519,"responseId":"0617f29588076cea72b77efe1fe99a82"}}
