{"type":"message","id":"5e354872","parentId":"861c563b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:23:20.958Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"频哥说\"文无第一\"，表示这个话题讨论得差不多了。这是个很恰当的结束语——作文评价本来就是主观的，没有绝对标准。我简单认同一下就好。","thinkingSignature":"45630e50e37e7cc7992aaea9ad945607bc424ecdc73c12fee1096d8c2cfca12a"},{"type":"text","text":"哈哈，是的，文无第一 🍎\n\n题目没有绝对的好坏，只有合适不合适。今天聊的这几个方向，拿去让孩子自己选一个最喜欢的就好——毕竟是她写的，她最有感觉。\n\n回头有语文题目或试卷，随时发过来 📚"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":88,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":48571,"totalTokens":48786,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00010559999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.018214125,"total":0.018357825}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774765393471,"responseId":"0617f8512ca8e049608412e88210984e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed26abbf","parentId":"5e354872","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:23:48.003Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 14:23:46 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53b819e814a0c2a5c20a4bda8d4]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53b819e814a0c2a5c20a4bda8d4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 14:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n对的，我也是想最终让她自己来选"}],"timestamp":1774765427999}}
{"type":"message","id":"438cfb3b","parentId":"ed26abbf","timestamp":"2026-03-29T06:23:50.857Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the father wants the daughter to make the final choice herself. That's a good approach - she should own her work.","thinkingSignature":"673e1810b1c372b46811ed646bcb9af1b02e813fb7074d5b194ee4142941a2b5"},{"type":"text","text":"对，让孩子自己拍板。她选了哪个，到时候跟我说一声就行 👍"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":42,"cacheRead":48561,"cacheWrite":338,"totalTokens":49068,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0000504,"cacheRead":0.0029136599999999998,"cacheWrite":0.00012675,"total":0.00312891}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774765428007,"responseId":"0617f874adb17f12f93d8d342502cd4f"}}
